# Stable spec ID: difford-el-presidente. Source checked 2026-10-13. Machine generated; not human reviewed or taste-tested.

::ingredients
(rum; light gold, 1-3 years old molasses column) 1 2/3 fl oz
(vermouth; dry @ Strucchi Dry, chilled) 1/2 fl oz
(vermouth; blanc @ Strucchi Bianco, chilled) 1/2 fl oz
(orange liqueur; curaçao @ Ferrand Dry Curaçao) 1/3 fl oz
(grenadine @ Monin) 1/12 fl oz
(choice 6) = (saline solution, 20g salt to 80g water) 2 drops -OR- (salt) 1 pinch

::equipment
(mixing glass)
(mesh strainer)
(coupe)

::instructions
<stir, measured ingredients with ice in (mixing glass)>
<fine-strain, into a chilled (coupe)>
<express citrus oil, from orange zest over the drink>
<garnish, with the zest>

